    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For SFO–Bangkok on January 8, the main trade-off is an earlier arrival versus a later start in San Francisco. Both award choices shown are economy and use Turkish miles, but the points quotes are not directly comparable with other programs’ points. The reported award amounts also do not establish a confirmed party total.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
      "canonical_id": null,
      "journey": null,
      "component": null,
      "lead": null,
      "unavailable": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "If getting to Bangkok earlier matters, the morning-departure option arrives at 4:15 a.m. on January 10. It leaves SFO at 6:18 a.m. on January 8, so the earlier arrival means a much earlier start; the full journey takes 30 hours 57 minutes.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
